            {
              "text": "Some manuscripts add verse 14:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "How terrible for you, teachers of the Law and Pharisees! You hypocrites! You take advantage of widows and rob them of their homes, and then make a show of saying long prayers! Because of this your punishment will be all the worse!",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "(see Mk 12.40).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
